# Traces written by failing runs; promote them to test-resources/ deliberately.
**/test-resources/quint-connect/failures/

# Apalache's log directory. `quint verify` writes it into whatever directory it
# was invoked from; quint-connect contains it in a scratch directory that it
# deletes, but running `quint verify` by hand from a spec directory leaves one
# behind. The name is Apalache's and cannot be changed — see
# docs/notes/itf-format.md §`quint verify`.
_apalache-out/

# nREPL writes this on every REPL start.
.nrepl-port
